{"translation":{"id":"kan_irv","name":"ಇಂಡಿಯನ್ ರಿವೈಜ್ಡ್ ವರ್ಸನ್ (IRV) - ಕನ್ನಡ - 2019","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=kanirv","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=kanirv","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"IRV","englishName":"Kannada Indian Revised Version Bible","language":"kan","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"82cc741009376c81c4416c230a757b2e30ef49b2e4672f9831adcedfc26b865f","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/kan_irv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31031,"languageName":"ಕನ್ನಡ","languageEnglishName":"Kannada"},"book":{"id":"PSA","translationId":"kan_irv","name":"ಕೀರ್ತನೆಗಳು","commonName":"ಕೀರ್ತನೆಗಳು","title":"ಕೀರ್ತನೆಗಳು","order":19,"numberOfChapters":150,"sha256":"08dbfe5ddc486dec386dace7278fb86473155bcc396458e2e5b52a02b2d0a830","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/kan_irv/PSA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":150,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/kan_irv/PSA/150.json","totalNumberOfVerses":2461},"chapter":{"number":131,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["ಭಕ್ತರ ದೀನಭಾವ"]},{"type":"hebrew_subtitle","content":["ಯಾತ್ರಾಗೀತೆ; ದಾವೀದನದು."]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"ಯೆಹೋವನೇ, ನನ್ನ ಹೃದಯದಲ್ಲಿ ಗರ್ವವಿಲ್ಲ;","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ನನಗೆ ಸೊಕ್ಕಿನ ಕಣ್ಣುಗಳಿಲ್ಲ;","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ಅಸಾಧ್ಯ ಕಾರ್ಯಗಳಿಗೆ ಕೈಹಾಕುವುದಿಲ್ಲ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ನಿಜವಾಗಿ ನನ್ನ ಮನಸ್ಸನ್ನು ಸಮಾಧಾನಪಡಿಸಿಕೊಂಡಿದ್ದೇನೆ;","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ತಾಯಿಯ ಮಡಿಲಲ್ಲಿರುವ ಮೊಲೆಬಿಡಿಸಿದ ಕೂಸಿನಂತೆ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ನನ್ನಲ್ಲಿ ನನ್ನ ಮನಸ್ಸು ಮೊಲೆಬಿಡಿಸಿದ ಕೂಸಿನಂತೆ ನೆಮ್ಮದಿಯಿಂದಿದೆ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ಇಸ್ರಾಯೇಲೇ, ಇಂದಿನಿಂದ ಯುಗಯುಗಕ್ಕೂ","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ಯೆಹೋವನನ್ನೇ ನಿರೀಕ್ಷಿಸಿಕೊಂಡಿರು.","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/kan_irv/PSA/131.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/kan_irv/PSA/132.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/kan_irv/PSA/130.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":3}